export default App; now the navigation is only visible on the root path / not on the others why?

model_response:
 The navigation is only visible on the root path because the navigation is wrapped in the `Layout` component, which is only rendered on the root path. The `Layout` component is not rendered on the other routes, so there is no navigation on those pages. To fix this, you can render the `Layout` component on all routes by wrapping the `Routes` component with the `Layout` component, like this:
```
function App() {
  return (
    <BrowserRouter>
      <Layout>
        <Routes>
          <Route path="/" element={<Home />} />
          <Route path="/Test" element={<ExampleComponent />} />
        </Routes>
      </Layout>
    </BrowserRouter>
  );
}
```
This way, the `Layout` component will be rendered on all pages, and the navigation will be visible on all routes.

